WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.890
A virus can't feed.

2
00:00:01.940 --> 00:00:03.070
It can't respire.

3
00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:05.090
It can't grow on its own.

4
00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:07.670
Yet it can break into
one of your cells,

5
00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:09.250
take over the cell's machinery,

6
00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:12.230
and use it to make copies of itself.

7
00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:15.390
So is a virus alive, or not?

8
00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:19.010
In this mission, you'll look
inside a virus and compare it with

9
00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:19.700
a cell.

10
00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:22.490
You'll find out how a
virus gets itself copied,

11
00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:24.190
and why it needs a host.

12
00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:27.550
And you'll meet the groups
that pathogens can come from,

13
00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:30.310
from bacteria to protoctists.

14
00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:33.090
Your mission: decide
whether a virus is alive,

15
00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:35.230
and back up your answer.
